Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}金星镇11公里 俄勒冈城133公里波特兰587公里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}汽车汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}办公室请直行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.79,0:01:22.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}三年前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.59,0:01:27.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}若需协助请按门铃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}尚有空空房
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:29.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}有人吗？\N{\rEN}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}请按我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.34,0:02:11.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}需要帮忙吗？\N{\rEN}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.05,0:02:15.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你好我想订今晚的住宿\N{\rEN}Hey, I'd like a room for the night, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:16.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}没问题\N{\rEN}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}晚119元加上75元押金\N{\rEN}That'll be $119 per night, plus a $75 deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:31.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你知道从这里到 金星镇市中心最好的方法吗？\N{\rEN}Do you know the best way to get to downtown Venus from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:33.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}当然我在那里出生长大\N{\rEN}Sure do. Born and raised there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}那里不能算是中心\N{\rEN}It's not really a downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:40.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这里人口只有486人 所以其实只是一条街\N{\rEN}We only have, like, 486 people, so it's like a street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.83,0:02:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}右转再左转直走就会到\N{\rEN}Take a right and then a left and you'll run right into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}离这里大概11公里里\N{\rEN}It's like 7 miles down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}谢谢\N{\rEN}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:51.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}在这里签名\N{\rEN}Sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:54.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}谢谢\N{\rEN}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:03.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你住24号房\N{\rEN}You're number 24.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:10.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}谢谢你的帮忙\N{\rEN}And thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.07,0:03:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}再手见\N{\rEN}See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.49,0:03:21.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}汽车汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:38.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我已经拿到浴袍谢谢\N{\rEN}I already got the robe. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:45.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}塔玛拉在吗？\N{\rEN}Is Tamara here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.69,0:03:51.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}不你走错昔房间 7\N{\rEN}No, you have the wrong room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}塔玛拉在吗？\N{\rEN}Is Tamara here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}24号房
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:41.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}拜托\N{\rEN}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}别伤害我\N{\rEN}Don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我做什：么？\N{\rEN}What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}为什么么要抓我？\N{\rEN}Why did you take me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}因 1为你来到这里\N{\rEN}Because you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:29.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}什么？\N{\rEN}What? What...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}连环杀手名词
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:41.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}指遵循特定的行为模式
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:44.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}犯下丙两起以上谋杀案的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:47.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}受害害者通常为陌生人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.77,0:12:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你还活着是吧？\N{\rEN}You're still alive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:02.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这是唯的出口\N{\rEN}This is the only way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:20.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}布雷特威士忌\N{\rEN}A bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}放轻松\N{\rEN}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这里没人有面面具\N{\rEN}Nobody has a mask here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:01.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}敬亡者\N{\rEN}To the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}请坐请\N{\rEN}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这是是敬他的\N{\rEN}It's for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:46.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}他叫菜莱恩\N{\rEN}His name was Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你杀 7 你朋友？\N{\rEN}They killed your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:20.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}对\N{\rEN}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}但我会交新的朋友\N{\rEN}But I'll make new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:35.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你们在起多久 7 ？\N{\rEN}How long were you together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}从最开始\N{\rEN}Since the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:44.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}从手我们小时候\N{\rEN}Since we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你是来为她祈祷的吗？\N{\rEN}Did you come here to pray for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.83,0:15:57.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你真的以为神会听我告解吗？\N{\rEN}Do you really think He'd listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你为莱恩.\N{\rEN}Did you pray...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:05.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}祈祷过吗？\N{\rEN}for Ryan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:15.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你杀了她\N{\rEN}You killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:20.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我不是是故意的\N{\rEN}I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.19,0:16:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你就是故意的\N{\rEN}Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:32.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}看来我们扯平了\N{\rEN}I guess we're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}现在怎么办？\N{\rEN}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:44.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}滚出去\N{\rEN}Get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:17:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你认为上帝为何让该隐杀了亚伯？\N{\rEN}Why do you think God let Cain kill Abel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.98,0:17:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我不知道\N{\rEN}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}对我也也不知道\N{\rEN}Yeah, I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:18.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}也许袍只是想看\N{\rEN}Maybe He just wanted to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:41.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}警长请回答\N{\rEN}Sheriff, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:50.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}请说汤米\N{\rEN}Go ahead, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:52.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}玛雅的姐姐黛比打来\N{\rEN}Maya's sister Debbie called.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}她叫了救护车去湖边小屋找玛雅\N{\rEN}She sent an ambulance to the lake house for Maya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}救护车不见了\N{\rEN}It's disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:17:58.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}不见 7 ？\N{\rEN}Disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:02.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}救护车公司失去联系司机没有回应\N{\rEN}Ambulance company has lost contact. Driver ain't responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.75,0:18:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}她姐姐正从波特兰赶来 明早就会抵达金星镇\N{\rEN}Sister's on her way from Portland. She's gonna be in Venus by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:11.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}去湖边小屋看急救人员是否在那里\N{\rEN}Go to the lake house. See if the EMT is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:13.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}收到\N{\rEN}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}完毕\N{\rEN}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}玛雅\N{\rEN}Maya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我们到处在找你\N{\rEN}We've been looking all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.46,0:18:44.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}警长言保护并服务人民
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你看起来像刚从地狱回来\N{\rEN}You look like you've been through hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我知道他们在哪里\N{\rEN}I know where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:57.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}在哪里？\N{\rEN}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}带我离开我就告诉你\N{\rEN}Get me out of here and I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你想去哪里？\N{\rEN}Where do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:07.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}去找我姐姐\N{\rEN}Wherever my sister is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:13.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你姐姐且正从波特兰赶来\N{\rEN}Your sister's on her way here from Portland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}好\N{\rEN}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}带我去找她\N{\rEN}Take me to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:21.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}借我用下手机\N{\rEN}and let me use your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.92,0:19:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我的手机在这里收不到讯号\N{\rEN}I never get any service out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:41.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}好吧\N{\rEN}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:51.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}天啊抱歉\N{\rEN}God, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:55.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你有急救箱吗？\N{\rEN}Do you have a first aid kit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.90,0:19:58.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我的手好痛\N{\rEN}My hand really hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}有\N{\rEN}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.51,0:20:19.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}后车车厢有\N{\rEN}Yeah, I got one in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:59.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}警长我正要去湖边小屋\N{\rEN}Sheriff, I'm en route to the lake house,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.09,0:21:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这里看似有起连续谋杀案\N{\rEN}and it looks like we have a 1249, multiple homicides.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:03.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}还是没找到那女孩\N{\rEN}Still no sign of the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:05.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你希望我们如何处理？完点毕\N{\rEN}How would you like us to proceed? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}不\N{\rEN}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:48.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}不\N{\rEN}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:51.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}不\N{\rEN}No, no, no! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.39,0:21:54.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}不\N{\rEN}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.28,0:22:50.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我困在十公里>口处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:52.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我们十分分钟后抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:22:59.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}般而言\N{\rEN}Typically...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:02.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}因为你儿子年纪还小\N{\rEN}due to your son's young age,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.55,0:23:04.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}塔玛拉谋杀案庭审
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.05,0:23:06.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}州法院通常会希望透过家长\N{\rEN}the state would prefer to attempt rehabilitation
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:07.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}试图矫正青少年行为\N{\rEN}through the parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.64,0:23:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}同时搭配定期咨询和进度追踪\N{\rEN}along with regular counseling and measured progress updates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:15.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}然而\N{\rEN}However,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.31,0:23:21.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}由于这些恶行令人发指\N{\rEN}due to the heinous and cruelly brutal nature of these acts,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.78,0:23:24.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}被告告应该受到监禁\N{\rEN}he should be incarcerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.03,0:23:28.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}罗特警长请起立\N{\rEN}Sheriff Rotter, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:33.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}本庭已经过审慎考虑\N{\rEN}I have given this great consideration,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.00,0:23:36.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}然而基于你\N{\rEN}but due, in no small part,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:39.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}在执法单位无懈可击的服务纪录\N{\rEN}to your impeccable record in law enforcement,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.13,0:23:42.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}本庭决定\N{\rEN}this court has decided
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.55,0:23:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}允许你保留儿子的监监护权\N{\rEN}to allow you to retain custody of your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.55,0:23:48.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}但若再有次违法行为\N{\rEN}But one infraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.43,0:23:54.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}本庭将会判处监禁至少到18岁\N{\rEN}and I will order incarceration until at least 18 years of age.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.89,0:23:56.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}谢谢庭上\N{\rEN}Thank you, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.14,0:23:58.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我是认真真的年轻人\N{\rEN}I mean it, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}几周后
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.03,0:24:08.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}怎么了小子？\N{\rEN}What happened, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.04,0:24:59.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这是你的第次\N{\rEN}That's your first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.31,0:25:22.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你把事情搞砸 A\N{\rEN}You made a real mess here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.50,0:25:41.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我一直希望这种事不会再发生\N{\rEN}I prayed this'd never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.88,0:25:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}但我知道道早晚还是会会\N{\rEN}Somehow I knew it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.26,0:25:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我会处理好的\N{\rEN}"Il fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.02,0:26:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}但旦不能再杀镇民了懂吗？\N{\rEN}But no more townsfolk, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.94,0:26:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}懂\N{\rEN}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}懂\N{\rEN}Yes, sir.
