Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.09,0:55:07.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}那现在王怎么办？\N{\rEN}So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.64,0:55:10.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这里看起来废弃 A\N{\rEN}It looks abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.27,0:55:18.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我会确保这里安全\N{\rEN}We'll make sure it's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.48,0:55:20.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你们留在这里\N{\rEN}You'll stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.40,0:55:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我去找他\N{\rEN}and I'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.57,0:55:28.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你会会用这吗？\N{\rEN}You know how to use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.70,0:55:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}在拖车里最好带着比较安全\N{\rEN}You'll be safer with this inside that trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.21,0:56:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}安全快进来\N{\rEN}Okay. Clear. Hurry in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.31,0:56:33.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}给你\N{\rEN}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.27,0:56:35.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}把门锁上\N{\rEN}Lock the door behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.02,0:56:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}只有我来才可以开门\N{\rEN}Open it only for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.56,0:56:39.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}其他人-律开枪\N{\rEN}Shoot through it for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.56,0:56:40.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}了解\N{\rEN}On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.01,0:57:14.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}俄勒冈锯木
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.70,0:59:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}放下武器\N{\rEN}Drop your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.16,0:59:39.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}霍华我好害怕\N{\rEN}Howard, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.37,0:59:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}嘿\N{\rEN}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.24,0:59:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我们会离开这里的小黛我保证\N{\rEN}We're gonna get out of here, Deb. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.12,0:59:46.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我们找到玛雅就走\N{\rEN}We'll get out when we find Maya.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.79,0:59:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这里到底是;怎么了？\N{\rEN}What the fuck is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.13,0:59:50.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我不知道\N{\rEN}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.71,0:59:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这是个破小镇\N{\rEN}This is one fucked-up small town.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.82,1:00:54.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我需要赞安诺\N{\rEN}I need a Xanax.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.37,1:01:08.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我有枪！\N{\rEN}I've got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.05,1:01:23.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}在哪里？\N{\rEN}Where is that? Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.21,1:01:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}妈的\N{\rEN}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.05,1:02:03.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}没事的\N{\rEN}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.76,1:02:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}一妈的！ 一这边！\N{\rEN}-Fuck! -This way! This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.10,1:02:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}该死\N{\rEN}Shit, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.48,1:02:14.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我会再开枪！ 1\N{\rEN}I'll shoot again!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.48,1:02:19.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}没事的，\N{\rEN}It's okay, it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.74,1:02:23.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}没事的，\N{\rEN}It's okay, it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.57,1:02:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}妈的\N{\rEN}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.97,1:02:46.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}妈的\N{\rEN}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.56,1:02:59.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}黛比你还好吗？\N{\rEN}Debbie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.76,1:03:23.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你还好吗？\N{\rEN}You okay? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.76,1:03:26.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我起不来\N{\rEN}I can't get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.51,1:03:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}霍华华我们得走了\N{\rEN}Howard, we've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.85,1:03:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}走开\N{\rEN}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.40,1:03:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}一走开！ -霍华！\N{\rEN}-Get away! -Howard!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.27,1:03:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}霍华\N{\rEN}Howard.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.42,1:03:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}玛雅\N{\rEN}Maya.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.66,1:06:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}有空再来别见外
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.45,1:10:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}即便罪人可能 用花言巧语隐藏他们的腐化堕落\N{\rEN}Though sinners may try and hide their corruption under honeyed words,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.25,1:10:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}主耶稣却看见这些坑里的仆人\N{\rEN}Lord Jesus sees these servants of the pit
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.13,1:10:18.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}看见他们扭曲内心潜伏的邪恶\N{\rEN}for the evil that lurks within their wicked heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.09,1:10:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}因为无论你将罪埋得深\N{\rEN}Because no matter how far down you bury your sin,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.47,1:10:28.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}罪恶感会像虫-样钻涌而！出\N{\rEN}it don't stay buried with the worms of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.18,1:10:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}除非上帝让你堕入地狱\N{\rEN}lt won't rest
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.02,1:10:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}否！则它们永不会\N{\rEN}until the Lord plunges you into that all-consuming pit called Hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.23,1:10:39.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}最好相信\N{\rEN}And best believe,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.82,1:10:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}地狱在主等着你\N{\rEN}hell is hungry for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.29,1:10:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}..将你抬升到恶魔无法触及之处\N{\rEN}...faise you high enough where the Devil can't reach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.67,1:10:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}现在让我们起称颂他\N{\rEN}Now, together, let's exalt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.55,1:11:02.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}请和我们的唱诗班起\N{\rEN}Please join our choir in singing...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.48,1:11:57.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.20,1:12:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}净化杀戮、我是天近选之子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.87,1:12:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}正义死亡救赎 孤独、俘获、痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.09,1:13:07.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}雪莉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.93,1:13:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}毕华业纪念册 2016年
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.19,1:13:23.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}祈祷、命运、报应、杀光所有人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.23,1:13:24.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你是天选之子
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.90,1:13:26.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}黑暗中没有光
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.19,1:14:06.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}现在你心！中只剩痛苦\N{\rEN}There's only pain in you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.49,1:14:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我心中什么都不剩了\N{\rEN}There's nothing in me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.67,1:14:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我解放了你\N{\rEN}I freed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.18,1:14:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}把面，具脱掉\N{\rEN}Take off your mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.85,1:14:43.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我想看看你\N{\rEN}I want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.13,1:15:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}这些年来\N{\rEN}All these years,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.55,1:15:14.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你是唯幸存的人\N{\rEN}you're the only one that survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.07,1:15:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}她很纯洁\N{\rEN}She was pure.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.91,1:15:39.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我在王黑暗中唯的光明\N{\rEN}My only light in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.91,1:15:43.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}黑暗中很寂静\N{\rEN}It's quiet in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.79,1:15:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}很宁静\N{\rEN}Serene.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.59,1:15:49.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.71,1:15:52.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}堕落天使
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.38,1:15:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我是来杀你的\N{\rEN}I came here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.39,1:16:02.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}那就动手吧\N{\rEN}So do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.19,1:16:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我在乎的切都消失了\N{\rEN}Everything I've ever cared about is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.44,1:16:13.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}你夺走 7 我的切\N{\rEN}You took it from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.72,1:16:36.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}只剩下你\N{\rEN}You're all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.00,1:17:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}弹匣空了\N{\rEN}It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.17,1:20:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}我们现在是同类类 A\N{\rEN}We're the same now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.90,1:20:59.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH}或许吧\N{\rEN}Maybe.
